  "bio": "Maty Bohacek is a researcher at Stanford University, previously Google DeepMind, working at the intersection of AI and media integrity. Maty's work—spanning deepfakes, AI-generated content on the web, AI evaluation, and AI governance—has been published at NeurIPS, ICML, and ICLR, and has been featured by CNN, BBC Radio 4, WIRED, and others. Maty co-created the award-winning Shell Game podcast with Evan Ratliff, and has been recognized with the Czech Senate Medal and a place on Forbes 30 Under 30."
